# Needs the dev test stock (TST) in a test save.
name holding cards show the average cost per share across buys at different prices
# the game's own Investments lists, whatever the "Investments list and research" flag says
investments-list off
set-price TST 100
run-days 1
remember TST
show-buy TST
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 4
click Button
wait 1
set-price TST 80
run-days 1
show-buy TST
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 4
click Button
wait 1
expect-owned-delta TST 8
show-economy
wait 2
scroll-into-view FinanceOverhaulAvgCost-TST
expect-in-view FinanceOverhaulAvgCost-TST OwnedInvestmentsPanel
expect-text FinanceOverhaulAvgCostValue-TST ₡90.00
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulAvgCost-TST
capture avg-cost
cleanup:
investments-list restore
sell-back TST 8
set-price TST 100
close-dialog
close-economy
